<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνομος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lawless, impious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράπεζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.162
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				142
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1096
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐχίονος γόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					995
				</span></i>
			; of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					151
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθη</span> E <i><span class="en">
				<u>Or.</u>
				1455
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοναρχία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					302e
				</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄνομα</span>”
				<i>lawless acts,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.8
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
					285a
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					1000
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				4.1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.92
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. θεοῦ,</span> i.e. <i>without (the
				Mosaic) Law</i> and therefore without God, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				9.21
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόμως,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρὶς νόμου</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>illegal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατοχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					237 vii 11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>unmusical,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμος ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1142
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
